-in-right"></i></a>\n          <a class="fizo-dash__kpi fz-kpi" href="{{ staff_dashboard_lodging_snapshot.reservations_url }}?lane=departures"><small>Departures</small><strong>{{ staff_dashboard_lodging_snapshot.departures }}</strong><i class="bi bi-box-arrow-right"></i></a>\n          <a class="fizo-dash__kpi fz-kpi" href="{{ staff_dashboard_lodging_snapshot.housekeeping_url }}"><small>Rooms ready</small><strong>{{ staff_dashboard_lodging_snapshot.ready_rooms }}</strong><i class="bi bi-door-open"></i></a>\n        </div>\n      {% elif staff_dashboard_sales_snapshot %}\n        <div class="fizo-dash__kpis">\n          <a class="fizo-dash__kpi fz-kpi" href="{{ staff_dashboard_sales_snapshot.detail_url }}"><small>Net sales · {{ staff_dashboard_sales_snapshot.currency_code }}</small><strong>{{ staff_dashboard_sales_snapshot.net_sales }}</strong><i class="bi bi-graph-up"></i></a>\n          <a class="fizo-dash__kpi fz-kpi" href="{{ staff_dashboard_sales_snapshot.detail_url }}"><small>Payments</small><strong>{{ staff_dashboard_sales_snapshot.payments_count }}</strong><i class="bi bi-receipt"></i></a>\n          <a class="fizo-dash__kpi fz-kpi" href="{{ staff_dashboard_sales_snapshot.detail_url }}"><small>Gross sales</small><strong>{{ staff_dashboard_sales_snapshot.gross_sales }}</strong><i class="bi bi-cash-stack"></i></a>\n          <a class="fizo-dash__kpi fz-kpi" href="{{ staff_dashboard_sales_snapshot.detail_url }}"><small>Refunds</small><strong>{{ staff_dashboard_sales_snapshot.refunds_total }}</strong><i class="bi bi-arrow-counterclockwise"></i></a>\n        </div>\n      {% elif staff_dashboard_operations_snapshot %}\n        <div class="fizo-dash__kpis">{% for metric in staff_dashboard_operations_snapshot %}\n          <a class="fizo-dash__kpi fz-kpi" href="{{ metric.url }}"><small>{{ metric.label }}</small><strong>{{ metric.value }}</strong><span class="fizo-dash__muted">{{ metric.detail }}</span></a>\n        {% endfor %}</div>\n      {% else %}\n        <div 